# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Git is told to store LF for every text file and to check LF out on every platform,
# so a Windows machine with `core.autocrlf=true` and a Linux contributor produce the
# same bytes. Without this, the checkout rewrite turns every file into a whole-file
# diff on the next `git status`, and a CRLF file can slip into a release.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalise, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
